{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14147","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14147/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14147/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14147/events","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/14147","id":4017537125,"node_id":"I_kwDOJYd5Dc7vdsBl","number":14147,"title":"[Feature Request] Separate invocation namespace for prompt files vs skills in the slash picker","user":{"login":"aktsmm","id":71251920,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjUxOTIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71251920?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aktsmm","html_url":"https://github.com/aktsmm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aktsmm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aktsmm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aktsmm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aktsmm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aktsmm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aktsmm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aktsmm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aktsmm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aktsmm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-03-03T16:17:21Z","updated_at":"2026-03-03T16:22:34Z","closed_at":"2026-03-03T16:20:56Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Problem\n\nTyping `/` shows prompt files, skills, and built-in commands in one flat list.\nWith 20+ custom entries this becomes hard to navigate, and there is no way to\nfilter by type.\n\nSkills have `user-invokable` and `disable-model-invocation` frontmatter to\ncontrol visibility. Prompt files have no equivalent — they always appear.\n\n## Ideas (non-exhaustive)\n\nThese are examples of possible approaches — any solution that separates the\nconcepts would be welcome:\n\n- **Separate prefix** — e.g. `//` for prompt files, keeping `/` for skills and\n  built-ins. This would fit the existing `@` / `#` / `/` pattern.\n- **Grouped picker** — show section headers (Built-in / Prompts / Skills) in the\n  current `/` list.\n- **Visibility parity** — add `user-invokable` (or equivalent) to prompt file\n  frontmatter so users can hide utility prompts from the picker.\n\n## Current asymmetry\n\n| | Skills | Prompt files |\n|---|:---:|:---:|\n| Appears in `/` picker | Yes | Yes |\n| `user-invokable` | Yes | No |\n| `disable-model-invocation` | Yes | No |\n| Cross-tool (CLI, coding agent) | Yes | No |\n\n## Related\n\n- #14134 — Show source location in the picker\n- #2354 — Prompt library","closed_by":{"login":"aktsmm","id":71251920,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjUxOTIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71251920?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aktsmm","html_url":"https://github.com/aktsmm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aktsmm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aktsmm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aktsmm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aktsmm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aktsmm/subscriptions","organizations_u